Package: h2fpefpexa
Title: H2FPEF Continuous Model (Probability of HFpEF) - ModelsCloud Service
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ramin", "Rezaeianzadeh", email = "raminrzn@student.ubc.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yogesh N. V.", "Reddy", role = "ctb",
           comment = "First author of the H2FPEF score"))
Description: Implements the continuous-variable H2FPEF model: the probability
    of heart failure with preserved ejection fraction in a patient with
    unexplained dyspnoea (Reddy et al., Circulation 2018
    <doi:10.1161/CIRCULATIONAHA.118.034646>), using the coefficients in the
    authors' online calculator workbook. Not the 0-9 point H2FPEF score,
    HFA-PEFF or HFpEF-ABA.
